<rml>
  <head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="ttld.rcss" />
    <title>To the Last Drop</title>
  </head>
  <body data-model="ttld">
    <div id="health-panel">
      <div id="health-heart"></div>
      <div id="health-bar">
        <div id="health-fill" data-style-width="healthPercent"></div>
        <div id="health-caption">{{healthCaption}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="target-panel" data-if="targetVisible">
      <div id="target-bar">
        <div id="target-fill" data-style-width="targetPercent"></div>
        <div id="target-caption">{{targetCaption}}</div>
      </div>
      <div id="target-name">{{targetName}}</div>
    </div>

    <div id="bindings">
      <div class="bind"><span class="key">1 :</span> Transfusion</div>
      <div class="bind"><span class="key">2 :</span> Heartburn</div>
      <div class="bind"><span class="key">3 :</span> Adrenaline</div>
      <div class="bind"><span class="key">4 :</span> Migraine</div>
      <div class="bind"><span class="key">5 :</span> Poultice</div>
      <div class="bind"><span class="key">Left click:</span> Move</div>
      <div class="bind"><span class="key">Right click :</span> Attack</div>
      <div class="bind"><span class="key">Ctrl+Q :</span> Quit</div>
    </div>

    <div id="intro" data-if="introVisible">
      <div id="intro-window">
        <div id="intro-title">Defend Your Town!</div>
        <div id="intro-controls">
          <div class="controls-title">Controls:</div>
          <div class="control"><span class="key">1 :</span> Transfusion</div>
          <div class="control-desc">Gain health at the expense of others.</div>
          <div class="control"><span class="key">2 :</span> Heartburn</div>
          <div class="control-desc">Causes a burning sensation.</div>
          <div class="control"><span class="key">3 :</span> Adrenaline</div>
          <div class="control-desc">Really gets you (and your allies) moving.</div>
          <div class="control"><span class="key">4 :</span> Migraine</div>
          <div class="control-desc">Unbearable headaches for your foes.</div>
          <div class="control"><span class="key">5 :</span> Poultice</div>
          <div class="control-desc">Draws orks towards you.</div>
          <div class="control"><span class="key">Left click:</span> Move</div>
          <div class="control"><span class="key">Right click :</span> Attack</div>
          <div class="control"><span class="key">Ctrl+Q :</span> Quit</div>
        </div>
        <div id="intro-story">
          <p>Usually the militia is more than a match for the occasional orkish raid. As the towns blood mage your contibution tends to be limited to patching up any wounded (at a heavy discount, of course). This time is different. Everyone who can weild a pitchfork is being urged to fight. A gigantic army headed by a fearsome (and massive) leader is approaching. There is no way the militia is up to the task, and, alas, your spells and effects are too weak to tip the balance.</p>
          <p>Unless... you were to crack open your book of Forbidden Magic. Powered by more than pricked fingers and vials of sheep blood, these spells may just be the tool required to save us. Well, most of us. The townsfolk will understand as, if any of us are to see the dawn...</p>
          <p class="sacrifice">Sacrifices must be made.</p>
        </div>
        <div id="intro-goals">
          <p>+ Protect the townsfolk.</p>
          <p>+ Kill the leader of the orks.</p>
          <p>+ Survive the night.</p>
          <p>+ Try to live with yourself afterwards.</p>
        </div>
        <div id="intro-play" class="button" data-event-click="introPlay()">Play</div>
        <div id="intro-exit" class="button" data-event-click="introExit()">Exit</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="endgame" data-if="endgameVisible">
      <div id="endgame-window">
        <div id="endgame-title" data-class-victory="endgameVictory">{{endgameTitle}}</div>
        <div id="endgame-line-one">{{endgameLineOne}}</div>
        <div id="endgame-line-two">{{endgameLineTwo}}</div>
        <div id="endgame-thanks">Thanks for playing!</div>
        <div id="endgame-restart" class="button" data-event-click="endgameRestart()">Restart</div>
        <div id="endgame-exit" class="button" data-event-click="endgameExit()">Exit</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</rml>
